Issue8689PathLambda.agda:36.1-37.32: error: [UnequalTerms]
The terms
  w
and
  n <ᵇ m
are not equal at type Bool
when checking that the type
(n m : Nat) (w : Bool) →
(min (suc (suc n)) (suc (suc m)) | w , (λ _ → w)) ≡
suc (min (suc n) (suc m) | w , (λ _ → w))
of the generated with function is well-formed
(https://agda.readthedocs.io/en/v2.10.0/language/with-abstraction.html#ill-typed-with-abstractions)
